# Backend Integration & Full Feature Implementation

**Goal**: Turn the static frontend forms into a production‑ready full‑stack application by implementing a robust Express.js REST API backed by Prisma ORM and PostgreSQL, adding authentication, file storage, real‑time features, AI integration, analytics, security, testing, CI/CD, and documentation.

