## Proposed Changes

### 1️⃣ Project Structure & Core Server

#### [NEW] [backend](file:///c:/Users/Dell/Downloads/overall/dev/obsidian/projects%20and%20it's%20code/codecollab_v2/backend)
- **backend/package.json** – project metadata, scripts, dependencies.
- **backend/server.js** – entry point, Express app, middleware registration, HTTP & HTTPS server.
- **backend/.env.example** – environment variable template (DB URL, JWT secret, S3 creds, etc.).

#### [NEW] [backend/prisma](file:///c:/Users/Dell/Downloads/overall/dev/obsidian/projects%20and%20it's%20code/codecollab_v2/backend/prisma)
- `schema.prisma` – data model mirroring all tables listed in the specification.
- `migrations/` – generated migration files.
- `seed.ts` – optional seed script.

#### [NEW] [backend/src](file:///c:/Users/Dell/Downloads/overall/dev/obsidian/projects%20and%20it's%20code/codecollab_v2/backend/src)
- **src/app.js** – Express app configuration (body parsers, CORS, helmet, rate limiter).
- **src/routes/** – folder containing route files per domain (auth.js, users.js, projects.js, issues.js, pull_requests.js, wiki.js, releases.js, attachments.js, chats.js, notifications.js, ai.js, search.js, admin.js).
- **src/controllers/** – controller functions for each route.
- **src/middlewares/** – auth middleware (JWT verification), RBAC checker, error handler, validation middleware (using `express-validator`).
